      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rancho_Mirage%2C_California",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Rancho Mirage Library and Observatory houses five telescopes and a 360‑degree dome, making it a local science hub.",
