      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rancho_Mirage%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2001, the Agua Caliente Casino opened on Bob Hope Drive, a landmark for the Agua Caliente Band of Cahuilla Indians.",
